Directory containing the <a href="https://www.emma02.hobby-site.com/nano.html">OscomNano</a> ROM file, Chip-8 interpreter file, and Nano example software. For Chip-8 software, see the Chip-8 directory.
</p>


<h2>NetronicsElfII</h2>
<p>
Directory containing <a href="https://www.emma02.hobby-site.com/elf2.html">Netronics Elf II</a> software, currently mainly used for the FULL BASIC Math/ROM Board files.
</p>


<h2>Payphone</h2>
<p>
Directory containing <a href="https://www.emma02.hobby-site.com/ct_payphone.html">Payphone</a> firmware and configuration files.
</p>


<h2>Pecom</h2>
<p>
Directory containing <a href="https://www.emma02.hobby-site.com/pecom.html">PECOM 32/64</a> firmware and software.
</p>


<h2>Pico</h2>
<p>
Directory containing <a href="https://www.emma02.hobby-site.com/picoelf.html">Pico/Elf V2</a> system ROMs, as well as command and LBR files.
</p>


<h3>Pico/TMS9918</h3>
