Directory containing the <a href="https://www.emma02.hobby-site.com/studio.html">RCA Studio II</a> ROM file, multi-cart ROM, and Studio II Chip-8.
</p>


<h2>StudioIII</h2>
<p>
Directory containing the <a href="https://www.emma02.hobby-site.com/victory.html">RCA Studio III</a> ROM file, multi-cart ROM, and Studio III Chip-8.
