Directory containing the <a href="https://www.emma02.hobby-site.com/telmac2000.html">Telmac TMC-2000</a> ROM file, Chip-8 interpreter file, and TMC example software. For Chip-8 software, see the Chip-8 directory.
</p>


<h2>UC1800</h2>
